        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Avianca, Synergy Group S.A., SCADTA\n- People: Germán Efromovich\n- Places: Colombia, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil\n- Topics: airline ownership, flag carriers\n\nFacts:\n- On 5 December 1919, Avianca was initially registered under the name SCADTA.\n- Since 5 December 1919, Avianca has been the national airline and flag carrier of Colombia.\n- Avianca S.A. is a Colombian airline, and its Spanish acronym stands for Aerovías del Continente Americano S.A.\n- Avianca is wholly owned by Synergy Group S.A.\n- Synergy Group S.A. is a South American holding company that specializes in air transport.\n- Germán Efromovich established Synergy Group S.A.\n- Synergy Group S.A. is headquartered in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.",
